    - key: 300
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2965c2e6d7e7ea42abf7182f9b60c04, type: 2}
        description: Rebel general-purpose frigate effective against corvettes and
          light cruisers. Four turbolaser batteries, four laser cannon batteries
          and targetable engines. Boost Shield Strength increases shield recovery
          tenfold for 15 seconds, reducing speed by 20% and weapon damage by 50%;
          60-second cooldown.
        role: General-purpose frigate / Anti-corvette
        iconKey: a5d07dd53c680c6408f3e98f4ce75765:21300000
        isHero: 0
        <Name>k__BackingField: Nebulon-B Frigate
