          type: 3}
    - key: 301
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0593bb86a7249c46b0e783c993fec3b, type: 2}
        description: Rebel anti-fighter and anti-bomber corvette with eight laser
          cannons, 500 hull and 800 shields. Power to Engines doubles speed for 20
          seconds, triples weapon delays and stops shield regeneration; 50-second
          recovery. Use it to screen larger ships, chase strikecraft or escape. Weak
          against frigates and capital ships.
        role: Anti-fighter / Anti-bomber
        iconKey: 68a48dec07691c448a7ed517f75c5a1a:21300000
        isHero: 0
